/.spec.js files. Extracted scanDirForACAnnotations helper. Added 4 new tests in coverage-cache.test.ts.\\n\\n2. PR thread resolution: Replied to all 7 open inline review threads explaining the fixes made in commit a298a9d5. Resolved all 7 threads via GitHub GraphQL API.\\n\\nPushed new commit 7978da81 with the coverage fix. Waiting for CI to pass (check-unresolved-comments should now succeed with all threads resolved).\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      }\n    ],\n    \"todos\": [],\n    \"automation\": \"eligible\",\n    \"_sourceFile\": \"/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"_ulid\": \"01KJBNJ1DSH5BZXHC12V9ZSWMX\",\n    \"slugs\": [\n      \"task-e2e-daemon-items-api\"\n    ],\n    \"title\": \"E2E tests for daemon Items API (replace daemon-api-items.test.ts)\",\n    \"type\": \"task\",\n    \"description\": \"Replace tests/daemon-api-items.test.ts (217 lines, all static analysis) with Playwright E2E tests.\\n\\nWrite: packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-items.spec.ts\\nUsing: daemon fixture from tests/fixtures/test-base.ts\\n\\nEndpoints to test:\\n- GET /api/items — list spec items with modules/features/requirements (@api-contract ac-8)\\n- GET /api/items?type=feature,requirement — multi-value type filter (@api-contract ac-9)\\n- GET /api/items/:ref — single item with acceptance_criteria, traits, relationships (@api-contract ac-10)\\n- GET /api/items/:ref/tasks — linked tasks via AlignmentIndex (@api-contract ac-11)\\n\\nAfter E2E tests pass, delete tests/daemon-api-items.test.ts.\\nRun: npm test && npm run test:e2e to verify.\\n\\nFixture data: packages/web-ui/tests/fixtures/modules/core.yaml has test spec items.\",\n    \"spec_ref\": null,\n    \"meta_ref\": null,\n    \"plan_ref\": null,\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"blocked_by\": [],\n    \"closed_reason\": \"Merged in PR #544. Replaced 217 lines of static analysis in tests/daemon-api-items.test.ts with 23 Playwright E2E tests in packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-items.spec.ts. All AC