i ACs and @trait-api-endpoint ACs covered with real HTTP calls to running daemon. All CI checks passed.\",\n    \"depends_on\": [],\n    \"context\": [],\n    \"priority\": 2,\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"testing\",\n      \"daemon\",\n      \"e2e\"\n    ],\n    \"vcs_refs\": [],\n    \"session_id\": \"01KJBZXXNHE3M4WX1BZ6Z5ZNCJ\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T00:28:46.838Z\",\n    \"started_at\": \"2026-02-26T04:34:28.288Z\",\n    \"submitted_at\": \"2026-02-26T05:36:07.584Z\",\n    \"completed_at\": \"2026-02-26T11:16:32.366Z\",\n    \"notes\": [\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJC7468Z6HCQWHFE1G0414DY\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T05:35:40.319Z\",\n        \"author\": \"@claude\",\n        \"content\": \"Written packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-triage.spec.ts with 34 Playwright E2E tests covering all 9 @triage-daemon-api ACs (ac-1 through ac-9). Tests use daemon fixture for real HTTP calls. Added project.triage.yaml fixture with 3 triage records (triaged, acted_on, pending statuses). Deleted tests/daemon-api-triage.test.ts (414 lines of static analysis). Unit test run: triage-specific tests pass.\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      }\n    ],\n    \"todos\": [],\n    \"automation\": \"eligible\",\n    \"_sourceFile\": \"/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"_ulid\": \"01KJBNJAPSK8858417YYGBFX7S\",\n    \"slugs\": [\n      \"task-e2e-daemon-errors-projects-api\"\n    ],\n    \"title\": \"E2E tests for daemon Error Handling + Projects API (replace 2 files)\",\n    \"type\": \"task\",\n    \"description\": \"Replace tests/daemon-api-error-handling.test.ts (148 lines) and tests/daemon-api-projects.test.ts (235 lines) with Playwright E2E tests. Both are all static analysis.\\n\\nWrite: packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-errors.spec.ts (or extend existing errors.spec.ts which currently uses mocks)\\nUsing: daemon fixture from tests/fixtures/test-base.ts\\n\\nError handling — make real requests that trigger each error type:\\n- GET /api/tasks/nonexistent-ref — 404 with {error, message, suggestion} (@api-contract ac-22)\\n- POST /api/tasks/:ref/note with empty body — 400 with {error, details:[{field, message}]} (@api-contract ac-23)\\n- POST /api/tasks/:ref/start on already-started task — 409 with {error, current, valid_transitions} (@api-contract ac-24)\\n\\nNote: existing errors.spec.ts uses route.fulfill() mocks. The new tests should hit the REAL daemon instead. Either extend that file with a real-daemon section or create api-errors.spec.ts.\\n\\nProjects API (uses daemon.createSecondProject helper):\\n- GET /api/projects — list registered projects with paths and watcherStatus (@multi-directory-daemon ac-28)\\n- POST /api/projects — register project with path validation (@multi-directory-daemon ac-29)\\n- DELETE /api/projects/:encodedPath — unregister project (@multi-directory-daemon ac-30)\\n\\nAfter E2E tests pass, delete both static files.\\nRun: npm test && npm run test:e2e to verify.\",\n    \"spec_ref\": null,\n    \"meta_ref\": null,\n    \"plan_ref\": null,\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"blocked_by\": [],\n    \"closed_reason\": \"Merged in PR #551. Replaced tests/daemon-api-error-handling.test.ts (148 lines) and tests/daemon-api-projects.test.ts (235 lines) with Playwright E2E tests. Created packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-errors.spec.ts (33 tests) covering @api-contract ac-22, ac-23, ac-24 with real HTTP calls to running daemon. Created packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-projects.spec.ts (13 tests) covering @multi-directory-daemon ac-28, ac-29, ac-30. Fix cycle resolved: corrected ac-23 to use custom 400 handler validation (whitespace text), fixed ac-5/6/7 misannotations to use ac-29, added explicit POST response assertion test. Resolved 3 unresolved GitHub review threads. All CI checks passing.\",\n    \"depends_on\": [],\n    \"context\": [],\n    \"priority\": 2,\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"testing\",\n      \"daemon\",\n      \"e2e\"\n    ],\n    \"vcs_refs\": [],\n    \"session_id\": \"01KJCTE1GG3AZEHZ5YWTTHWCHF\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T00:28:49.241Z\",\n    \"started_at\": \"2026-02-26T11:45:27.209Z\",\n    \"submitted_at\": \"2026-02-26T11:45:30.587Z\",\n    \"completed_at\": \"2026-02-26T11:45:57.259Z\",\n    \"notes\": [\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJCTPC9QPYRQ5ESZXJVTCQV7\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T11:17:39.255Z\",\n        \"author\": \"@claude\",\n        \"content\": \"Reading existing test files: daemon-api-error-handling.test.ts (148 lines, static analysis) and daemon-api-projects.test.ts (235 lines, static/documentary tests). Projects route is fully implemented in packages/daemon/src/routes/projects.ts. Writing api-errors.spec.ts for error handling ACs (ac-22, ac-23, ac-24) and api-projects.spec.ts for projects API ACs (ac-28, ac-29, ac-30). Existing errors.spec.ts uses mocks — creating separate api-errors.spec.ts for real daemon tests.\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJCV8F93ECZTVF1GMCTDCX6A\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T11:27:32.131Z\",\n        \"author\": \"@claude\",\n        \"content\": \"Created packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-errors.spec.ts (33 tests) covering @api-contract ac-22, ac-23, ac-24 with real HTTP calls. Created packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-projects.spec.ts (13 tests) covering @multi-directory-daemon ac-28, ac-29, ac-30. Deleted tests/daemon-api-error-handling.test.ts (148 lines) and tests/daemon-api-projects.test.ts (235 lines). All unit test suites pass (54 files, 1173 tests). N/A trait annotations added for all inherited traits.\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJCVT4RNWJKA9G74BZFRS12S\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T11:37:11.189Z\",\n        \"author\": \"@claude\",\n        \"content\": \"Fixed Codex review MUST-FIX issues: (1) api-errors.spec.ts: Added proper ac-23 test sending empty text string to hit custom 400 handler with {error, details} shape. Clarified 422 tests are Elysia framework validation. (2) api-projects.spec.ts: Corrected AC annotations on POST path validation tests from ac-5/6/7 (X-Kspec-Dir header ACs) to ac-29 (POST /api/projects endpoint). Consolidated redundant POST tests. Pushed fix commit.\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJCVZHBT0GN16X5ZN4DAYDFB\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T11:40:07.930Z\",\n        \"author\": \"@claude\",\n        \"content\": \"[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Review findings: CI check-unresolved-comments is FAILING due to 3 unresolved GitHub review threads from prior Codex review. The code fixes were applied in commit 6e045e45 but the threads were never resolved in GitHub. Worker must resolve the 3 threads: (1) api-errors.spec.ts:153 ac-23 422 test thread, (2) api-projects.spec.ts ac-5/6/7 annotation thread, (3) api-projects.spec.ts POST test structure suggestion. Code is correct — only GitHub thread resolution needed.\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      }\n    ],\n    \"todos\": [],\n    \"automation\": \"eligible\",\n    \"_sourceFile\": \"/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"_ulid\": \"01KJBNJCYDTFHTDB60DJFM1356\",\n    \"slugs\": [\n      \"task-e2e-daemon-server-core\"\n    ],\n    \"title\": \"E2E tests for daemon Server core (replace daemon-server.test.ts)\",\n    \"type\": \"task\",\n    \"description\": \"Replace tests/daemon-server.test.ts (310 lines) with Playwright E2E tests. Currently all static analysis except the localhost middleware unit tests (lines 59-188).\\n\\nWrite: packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-server.spec.ts\\nUsing: daemon fixture from tests/fixtures/test-base.ts\\n\\nBehaviors to test:\\n- GET /api/health — verify response shape {status: 'ok', uptime, connections, version} (@daemon-server ac-11)\\n- CORS headers — fetch from test, verify Access-Control-Allow-Origin includes localhost:5173 (@daemon-server ac-15, @api-contract ac-1)\\n- Verify daemon is only accessible on localhost (the middleware unit tests at lines 59-188 are already behavioral — move them to a vitest file like tests/daemon-localhost-middleware.test.ts, or keep them in the same file with only the behavioral tests) (@daemon-server ac-3)\\n\\nFor the static tests being deleted (ac-1 Elysia dep, ac-2 hostname binding, ac-12 signal handlers): these are verified implicitly — if the daemon starts and responds to health checks, it's bound correctly. Signal handler shutdown is tested in cli-serve.test.ts.\\n\\nAfter E2E tests pass, delete the static analysis tests from daemon-server.test.ts. Keep the localhost middleware unit tests (lines 59-188) in place — they test real logic.\\nRun: npm test && npm run test:e2e to verify.\",\n    \"spec_ref\": null,\n    \"meta_ref\": null,\n    \"plan_ref\": null,\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"blocked_by\": [],\n    \"closed_reason\": \"Merged in PR #553. Replaced static analysis tests in tests/daemon-server.test.ts with Playwright E2E tests in packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-server.spec.ts. Tests cover @daemon-server ac-1, ac-2, ac-3, ac-11, ac-15, @api-contract ac-1, and @trait-localhost-security. Kept behavioral unit tests for localhost middleware in daemon-server.test.ts. Deleted static analysis tests that only read source files.\",\n    \"depends_on\": [],\n    \"context\": [],\n    \"priority\": 2,\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"testing\",\n      \"daemon\",\n      \"e2e\"\n    ],\n    \"vcs_refs\": [],\n    \"session_id\": \"01KJCTE1GG3AZEHZ5YWTTHWCHF\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T00:28:51.533Z\",\n    \"started_at\": \"2026-02-26T11:47:01.975Z\",\n    \"submitted_at\": \"2026-02-26T12:58:15.251Z\",\n    \"completed_at\": \"2026-02-26T12:58:16.329Z\",\n    \"notes\": [],\n    \"todos\": [],\n    \"automation\": \"eligible\",\n    \"_sourceFile\": \"/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"_ulid\": \"01KJBNJF6Z5F9EPA0J0VDKTQ20\",\n    \"slugs\": [\n      \"task-e2e-daemon-websocket\"\n    ],\n    \"title\": \"E2E tests for daemon WebSocket (replace daemon-websocket.test.ts)\",\n    \"type\": \"task\",\n    \"description\": \"Replace tests/daemon-websocket.test.ts (591 lines, all static analysis) with Playwright E2E tests.\\n\\nWrite: packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-websocket.spec.ts\\nUsing: daemon fixture from tests/fixtures/test-base.ts\\n\\nNote: existing connection.spec.ts tests WebSocket reconnection via the UI. These new tests should verify the WebSocket protocol directly using page.evaluate() to create raw WebSocket connections, or use Playwright's page.waitForEvent('websocket') API.\\n\\nBehaviors to test:\\n- Connect to ws://localhost:3456/ws — receive 'connected' event with session_id (@api-contract ac-25)\\n- Send subscribe command — receive ack response with matching command_id (@api-contract ac-26, ac-27)\\n- Trigger a mutation (POST /api/tasks/:ref/note) — receive broadcast event via WebSocket (@api-contract ac-28 through ac-33)\\n- Heartbeat: server sends ping, client responds pong (@trait-websocket-protocol ac-5)\\n\\nNote: existing E2E connection.spec.ts has a SKIPPED test for WebSocket task updates due to 'daemon WebSocket upgrade returns 200 instead of 101'. Investigate if this is still an issue. If WebSocket connections work in the fixture, the skip can be removed.\\n\\nAfter E2E tests pass, delete tests/daemon-websocket.test.ts.\\nRun: npm test && npm run test:e2e to verify.\",\n    \"spec_ref\": null,\n    \"meta_ref\": null,\n    \"plan_ref\": null,\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"blocked_by\": [],\n    \"closed_reason\": \"Merged in PR #556. Replaced static analysis tests in tests/daemon-websocket.test.ts with 13 Playwright E2E tests in packages/web-ui/tests/e2e/api-websocket.spec.ts. Tests cover all applicable ACs: @api-contract ac-25 through ac-31, @trait-websocket-protocol ac-1/2/3/4, @daemon-server ac-4. Applied N/A annotations with justifications for trait ACs that don't apply (ac-5 requires 90s timeout infra, ac-33 has daemon shutdown gap). Fixed all Codex review findings